# Patterns for secret scanners to skip. One regular expression per line
# (RE2/Go syntax, the format TruffleHog's --exclude-paths parses; the
# baseline-check gate validates each line with Python's re). NOT
# gitignore-glob syntax.
# See damien-robotsix/robotsix-standards docs/secret-files-are-never-tracked.md.
# Consumed by the `security` job in .github/workflows/ci.yml (TruffleHog
# --exclude-paths).
#
# Add a pattern here when a tracked file triggers a scanner false positive,
# rather than adding it to .gitignore. Each addition is reviewed in a PR.

# Synthetic Vaultwarden vault builder: hard-coded test master password and
# generated keys / EncString blobs that look like real credentials.
^tests/vault_fixtures\.py$
# Test fixture data directories (recorded pages, canned payloads).
^tests/fixtures/
# Recorded HTTP archives and HTML page snapshots captured from browser
# sessions; they may embed session cookies / token-like strings from
# throwaway test accounts.
^tests/.*\.har$
^tests/.*snapshots?/
